<section class="exit-dialog" id="exit-dialog" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="退出确认">
  <button class="exit-dialog-scrim" type="button" data-close-exit aria-label="关闭退出确认"></button>
  <div class="exit-dialog-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="exit-dialog-title">
    <p class="exit-dialog-overline">END CURRENT SESSION</p>
    <h2 id="exit-dialog-title">要离开孤独之海吗？</h2>
    <p>阅读位置会留在这里。网页不会被强制关闭。</p>
    <div class="exit-dialog-actions">
      <button type="button" data-exit-modal-answer="yes"><span>YES</span><small>END SESSION</small></button>
      <button type="button" data-exit-modal-answer="no"><span>NO</span><small>RETURN TO TITLE</small></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
